# Legacy pre-Postgres data files. Pledges, settings and notifications now
# live in Postgres (see lib/db.js) and these are no longer read or written
# at runtime; ignored in case leftover copies exist locally from before the
# migration (scripts/migrate-json-to-postgres.mjs). data/budget.json is NOT
# ignored — it's a curated, read-only file bundled with the app.
/data/settings.json
/data/pledges.json
/data/notifications.json
